      "text": "B.    Use capital letters, full stop (.), comma (,),\nquestion mark (?), wherever necessary and\nrewrite the following sentences.\n1.   the air was filled with the clinking of glass\n2.   On diwali night the streets of Firozabad were\nlit with lamps and lights\n3.   did ravi like ananya’s new designs at first\n4.   ravi and ananya made a special collection for\ndiwali\n5.   did the customers love the new bangles",
