      "id": "class05_01_english_110_assess_1_44364be3",
      "type": "poem",
      "text": "A.    Answer the following questions.\n1.   How were glass bangles made in Ravi’s small\nworkshop?\n2.   Who was Ananya? How did she help Ravi?\n3.   How did the success of the new bangles help\nthe community?",
      "answer": null,
      "source": {
        "file": "03_ASSESS\\01_TEXTBOOK_ASSESSMENTS\\TEXTBOOK_ASSESSMENTS.json",
        "page": 5
